OL,3,GNEWSASex and dating for the sandwich
OL,4,Ageneration - Sharon Horgan on her
OL,5,Alatest comedy Youth
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe HBO Max series sees Horgan's
OL,8,Fcharacter, Alex, gamely attempting to
OL,9,Fjuggle a stressful publishing career
OL,10,Fwhile looking after a teenage son and
OL,11,Felderly parents. She's part of the
OL,12,Fso-called sandwich generation, those in
OL,13,Fmidlife who have to juggle caring
OL,14,Fresponsibilities for old and young
OL,15,Fwhile often working, too.
OL,17,FAnd that's not all - Alex is also back
OL,18,Fin the dating game following a divorce.
